sequenceDiagram
    participant MMesh as ModelMesh Control Plane<br/>(mmesh.ModelMesh)
    participant Adapter as Runtime Adapter Sidecar<br/>(mmesh.ModelRuntime)<br/>Pod-local gRPC
    participant Puller as model-serving-puller<br/>(pullman library)
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>(Azure/GCS/S3)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Backend as Backend Runtime<br/>(Triton/MLServer/TorchServe)<br/>gRPC

    Note over MMesh,Backend: Model Loading Flow

    MMesh->>Adapter: loadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC (pod-local, no auth)
    Adapter->>Puller: Download model artifacts
    Puller->>Storage: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (cloud SDK auth)
    Storage-->>Puller: Model files
    Puller-->>Adapter: Artifacts stored locally

    alt Triton Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: RepositoryModelLoad<br/>gRPC (inference.GRPCInferenceService)
    else MLServer Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: ModelInfer setup<br/>gRPC (GRPCInferenceService)
    else TorchServe Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: RegisterModel<br/>gRPC (ManagementAPIsService)
    end

    Backend-->>Adapter: Load confirmation
    Adapter-->>MMesh: loadModel response<br/>(model size, max concurrency)

    Note over MMesh,Backend: Model Status Check

    MMesh->>Adapter: runtimeStatus()<br/>gRPC (pod-local)

    alt Triton Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: ServerReady / ModelReady<br/>gRPC
    else MLServer Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: ServerReady / ModelReady<br/>gRPC
    else TorchServe Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: Ping<br/>gRPC (InferenceAPIsService)
    end

    Backend-->>Adapter: Status response
    Adapter-->>MMesh: runtimeStatus response<br/>(capacity, max loading concurrency)

    Note over MMesh,Backend: Inference Flow (via ModelMesh routing)

    MMesh->>Adapter: ensureLoaded / proxy<br/>gRPC
    alt Triton Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: ModelInfer / ModelStreamInfer<br/>gRPC (inference.GRPCInferenceService)
    else MLServer Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: ModelInfer<br/>gRPC (GRPCInferenceService)
    else TorchServe Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: Predictions<br/>gRPC (InferenceAPIsService)
    end
    Backend-->>Adapter: Inference result
    Adapter-->>MMesh: Prediction response

    Note over MMesh,Backend: Model Unloading Flow

    MMesh->>Adapter: unloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC (pod-local)
    alt Triton Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: RepositoryModelUnload<br/>gRPC
    else TorchServe Backend
        Adapter->>Backend: UnregisterModel<br/>gRPC (ManagementAPIsService)
    end
    Backend-->>Adapter: Unload confirmation
    Adapter-->>MMesh: unloadModel response
